# oracle: compute erotate/asphere with tri particles (four triangles, 3d): the body-frame sum I_k wb_k^2 with the
#   principal moments of each triangle, wb = R^T L / I (src/ASPHERE/compute_erotate_asphere.cpp at b332f28, the tri
#   branch of compute_scalar). Measured with native LAMMPS (black box); angular momenta set with set (group all angmom).
# oracle-inputs: w105cf_erotate_tri.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all rel=1e-12 abs=1e-14
units           lj
atom_style      tri
read_data       w105cf_erotate_tri.data
group           all type 1
pair_style      lj/cut 1.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0
set             group all angmom 0.4 -0.3 0.8
compute         1 all erotate/asphere
thermo_style    custom step c_1
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             0
